<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-16T09:59:47.990Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:59:47 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have seized a key town in Tigray that includes the regional airport and are advancing toward an Eritrean border town, while fighting in Amhara has left at least 183 dead, according to the UN. Militia reports say Eritrean forces suffered losses as Ethiopian troops expand control in Tigray, and the United States is urging Ethiopia and Eritrea to de-escalate. Hospitals in Tigray have resumed operations as supplies arrive, and the Ethiopian Red Cross condemned an attack that killed an ambulance driver in Benishangul-Gumuz. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQb3J5Sk1xdnNwNXYtQnlMOVhHU1l6SDdRUjZXenFGQWxLWVN3LWV5eXdfVWdWY0xfT1B3aU9GTEw4YUlVNndBZldKR3hQNkZ1M1BaTGR2YUp2RUE2NFZZWWdQQ08td2dfbmhqYkc3YkZtdk1aTTRaazBkRGs3WjBVMWhkc2ozX2hIel9qUG16QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUzg5bHdMQnB0TTJENDN5Sk0tUlpTTG5Lb1AzY2ZCaEpmaV9fTVQzMWtRMXdWX2RnczBRZ1h0UXY0UW14eTdQSlh0RURMQWRNYkUtZGRfaVZMaVZQSnp0MXZla2JPbFM2cENMV3RjUnRxOXhKc1Bsc1JPcmNhcWlCTVA5MGtZNk9FQmxWSlU5UG9HQkNiNDFsaEdSTzVBaXlGZFlEUFhhRkszWlNkRi1BaDB0T2JHckIy0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBQclR3dlVGRktnOWlnOXB3aG9oSE4tY0w0bjBJeG9IX3daX3ZzQkJQd0VaMDhKY1BnRFBEQ0daUnRURzdoSjk5QThEOWNfenlzWGI2MkNoUzM4eFpIWDVQWGZJRW50OTZiRWRIWVAyY0xwSWxKejkwTll3RmNicURLTUhDc2ttLVFmNW44MEZxdXctTDEzS1hackNMdkQzMFBEUlU5aWZIUkR2Y3o0dWJJMTFheVg4MFROd3FXNFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTFBjeDdwcUNqOGxLaFpyMFBweEkyeU9fOXl3VDB6UlRRNjRjc0V1SHl5RFhZT1kwMnI4WmVZR0ljMXczWGdENzU4c2xJNWRvYTZucnQ1VFpxN2ZjMG1RSjlOTXVtS1FscFkwOEpJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;